#. Description of the plugin
#: tegatai-secure.php
msgid ""
"Firewall, login protection with 2FA, anti-spam, scanners, server rules, "
"encrypted database backups and IP ban sharing between your own sites."
msgstr ""
"Firewall, Login-Schutz mit 2FA, Anti-Spam, Scanner, Server-Regeln, "
"verschlüsselte Datenbank-Backups und Austausch von IP-Sperren zwischen "
"deinen eigenen Seiten."

