#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Activates the Web Application Firewall to block malicious requests."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviert die Web Application Firewall, um bösartige Anfragen zu blockieren."

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Block Bad Bots"
msgstr "Bad Bots blockieren"

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Blocks known malicious bots, scrapers, and automated attack tools."
msgstr ""
"Blockiert bekannte bösartige Bots, Scraper und automatisierte Angriffstools."

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Rate Limit"
msgstr "Rate Limit"

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Prevents brute-force attacks by limiting requests per minute."
msgstr ""
"Verhindert Brute-Force-Angriffe durch Begrenzung der Anfragen pro Minute."

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "404 Trap"
msgstr "404 Falle"

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Bans IPs that generate too many 404 Not Found errors."
msgstr "Sperrt IPs, die zu viele 404-Fehler verursachen."

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Blocks uploads of executable or disguised script files."
msgstr "Blockiert Uploads ausführbarer oder getarnter Skriptdateien."

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Block AI Bots"
msgstr "KI-Bots blockieren"

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid ""
"Stops OpenAI, ChatGPT, and other AI scrapers from crawling your content."
msgstr ""
"Hindert OpenAI, ChatGPT und andere KI-Scraper daran, deine Inhalte zu "
"crawlen."

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Block SEO Bots"
msgstr "SEO-Bots blockieren"

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "Blocks aggressive SEO crawlers like Ahrefs or Semrush."
msgstr "Blockiert aggressive SEO-Crawler wie Ahrefs oder Semrush."

#: includes/admin.php:1052
msgid "WAF Whitelist"
