"One peer per line: \"URL | ed25519:public key\" (recommended; only public "
"keys are stored) or \"URL\" (shared secret from the secrets file). Older "
"\"URL | pair secret\" lines still work, but the pair secret is stored in the"
" database. Peers with a key are only accepted with their Ed25519 signature."
